information:
Registration will be closed at midnight on August, 22 or when we reach 70 competitors.
Spectators are welcome and do not need to register or pay. 
Registration fee:
* **100 RUB (~2 USD)**  for any one event (for ex. 3x3x3 Cube only);
* **200 RUB (~4 USD)**  for any 2-3 events;
* **300 RUB (~6 USD)**  for any 4 events and more;

If you do not see your name on the compeitors table after 48 hours of registering, please [contact us](mailto:g.sloboda@mail.ru,Lexkov27@gmail.com) to resolve the issue.

Visit the competition [website](https://vk.com/kurskopen2018) for more details.
